1
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,290
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:46,400
[Episode 7]

3
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:47,160
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Author: Shan Gujun]

5
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:51,460
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

6
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:50,680
Congratulations to Hongzheng Law Firm

7
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:52,000
on becoming Zhuoyuan Technology's

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,440
long-term partner.

9
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,720
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

10
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:01,880
Thank you, Mr. Zhuo,

11
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,140
for this opportunity.

12
00:01:04,019 --> 00:01:04,640
Xiao,

13
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:07,440
this is Zhuoyuan Technology's
legal representation agreement.

14
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,440
Please review it.

15
00:01:08,890 --> 00:01:11,110
I'd also like you to assign
an on-site attorney

16
00:01:11,110 --> 00:01:13,240
to handle our domestic acquisitions.

17
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,360
Of course.

18
00:01:14,470 --> 00:01:16,640
Shu has experience with corporate cases.

19
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:18,440
She can be your on-site counsel.

20
00:01:19,710 --> 00:01:20,800
Sounds good, Xiao.

21
00:01:21,530 --> 00:01:22,400
Mr. Zhuo.

22
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:28,039
If there are no other questions--

23
00:01:28,039 --> 00:01:29,280
I have a question.

24
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:46,180
This is Zhuoyuan Technology's
Chief Technology Officer,

25
00:01:46,180 --> 00:01:47,080
Ms. Wen Jian.

26
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,539
Hello, Ms. Wen.

27
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:54,650
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

28
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:55,640
Excuse me.

29
00:01:59,740 --> 00:02:01,680
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

30
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:02,760
Zhuoyuan Technology's partnership

31
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:05,120
with the MA valuation firm

32
00:02:05,150 --> 00:02:06,880
has never been made public.

33
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:10,240
How did you learn about it, Xiao?

34
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:14,000
Was your source obtained
through proper channels?

35
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:16,860
Shu handled the matter

36
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:18,760
for our firm.

37
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:27,000
It's been a while.

38
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,120
Tinglan.

39
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:30,760
Is that you?

40
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:36,079
Tinglan is my only baby girl.

41
00:02:37,050 --> 00:02:38,120
Dad.

42
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,440
I just want Wen Jian

43
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:41,720
to call him Dad openly.

44
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:45,040
My dad has only one daughter.

45
00:02:52,079 --> 00:02:52,920
Tinglan.

46
00:02:53,540 --> 00:02:55,400
Explain the situation to Ms. Wen.

47
00:02:58,320 --> 00:03:00,480
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

48
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:02,290
- About the MA valuation firm--
- Wen Jian.

49
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:03,880
Hongzheng Law Firm helped us

50
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:05,480
win the data breach case.

51
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:07,160
I gave them

52
00:03:07,260 --> 00:03:08,860
the MA valuation documents.

53
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:11,060
The process followed every rule.

54
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,080
I see.

55
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:16,370
It seems I was worried for nothing.

56
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:18,640
Shu.

57
00:03:19,579 --> 00:03:20,220
Then,

58
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,840
here's to working together.

59
00:03:24,329 --> 00:03:25,930
Here's to working together.

60
00:03:35,250 --> 00:03:36,120
Xiao.

61
00:03:37,990 --> 00:03:38,760
I...

62
00:03:39,079 --> 00:03:40,090
I'd like to request

63
00:03:40,090 --> 00:03:41,690
to step down as Zhuoyuan's--

64
00:03:51,079 --> 00:03:51,720
Hello?

65
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,079
Ms. Shu.

66
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:55,560
Your mother is now taking
a new imported medication.

67
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:57,690
The medication bill must be paid soon.

68
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,360
I understand.

69
00:04:01,690 --> 00:04:02,440
Tinglan.

70
00:04:02,930 --> 00:04:04,760
You don't look well today.

71
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:07,240
Think it over.

72
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,240
What exactly do you want
to request?

73
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,330
I'd like to take the day off.

74
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:14,440
All right.

75
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,480
Tinglan.

76
00:04:54,909 --> 00:04:55,880
Tinglan.

77
00:04:57,860 --> 00:04:59,460
What's wrong with you today?

78
00:05:00,070 --> 00:05:01,680
You don't look well.

79
00:05:02,420 --> 00:05:04,440
So the partner you kept mentioning

80
00:05:05,550 --> 00:05:06,520
was Wen Jian.

81
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,120
Yes.

82
00:05:09,570 --> 00:05:11,440
We started the company together.

83
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,750
She's great at both business

84
00:05:13,750 --> 00:05:15,530
and technology.

85
00:05:15,570 --> 00:05:16,440
What about me?

86
00:05:19,180 --> 00:05:21,200
What am I to you?

87
00:05:22,660 --> 00:05:24,600
I should be asking you that.

88
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,600
So tell me,

89
00:05:32,570 --> 00:05:33,920
what am I to you?

90
00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:37,120
Zhuo Yu'an.

91
00:05:39,010 --> 00:05:40,610
Whatever this is between us,

92
00:05:41,820 --> 00:05:42,970
I don't want it to continue.

93
00:05:42,970 --> 00:05:43,880
Okay?

94
00:05:44,940 --> 00:05:46,340
Did I do something wrong?

95
00:05:47,730 --> 00:05:48,720
Give me a reason.

96
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,320
A reason?

97
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:54,380
Here's your reason.

98
00:05:54,380 --> 00:05:56,680
I've tried so hard
to leave the past behind

99
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,280
and start my life over.

100
00:05:59,010 --> 00:06:01,120
Why do you both keep pushing me?

101
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,440
Forget it.

102
00:06:07,610 --> 00:06:08,640
It's my own fault.

103
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:10,880
I was crazy

104
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,520
to take you home

105
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:15,840
that day

106
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,480
when I barely knew you.

107
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,800
I never should've started this mess

108
00:06:20,890 --> 00:06:22,640
or thought you were serious.

109
00:06:24,050 --> 00:06:26,110
Then none of this would've happened.

110
00:06:27,790 --> 00:06:28,440
I...

111
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:30,150
I was always serious

112
00:06:30,170 --> 00:06:31,280
about us.

113
00:06:38,100 --> 00:06:38,800
Tinglan.

114
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,850
You haven't been yourself lately.

115
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,320
I'll give you some space.

116
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:47,600
Get some rest.

117
00:07:29,540 --> 00:07:30,160
Lan.

118
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:31,440
Lan, come back now!

119
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:32,200
Your dad is going to jump!

120
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,460
Come back and stop him!

121
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:01,800
I got you some food.

122
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,040
It's outside your door.

123
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,170
Don't forget to eat.

124
00:08:20,300 --> 00:08:22,120
[Pork Chop]

125
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,320
Ms. Li was about to inherit
her husband's estate

126
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,220
when she learned he had
a child with another woman.

127
00:09:06,220 --> 00:09:07,630
Under the law,

128
00:09:07,650 --> 00:09:10,330
children born outside marriage
also have inheritance rights.

129
00:09:10,330 --> 00:09:12,560
Sometimes, closer family ties

130
00:09:12,580 --> 00:09:14,440
may even work in their favor.

131
00:09:14,700 --> 00:09:16,750
We invited an expert to discuss the issue.

132
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:18,410
Please welcome Professor Gu.

133
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,320
Good morning,

134
00:10:17,180 --> 00:10:17,880
Tinglan.

135
00:10:20,650 --> 00:10:21,850
Aren't you coming in?

136
00:10:22,540 --> 00:10:23,870
You'll be late for work.

137
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:43,480
It's been a long time.

138
00:10:44,530 --> 00:10:46,530
Don't you want to catch up,
Tinglan?

139
00:10:47,060 --> 00:10:48,320
There's nothing for us

140
00:10:48,700 --> 00:10:49,960
to catch up on, Ms. Wen.

141
00:10:51,100 --> 00:10:52,900
If anything remains between us,

142
00:10:56,900 --> 00:10:57,840
it's hate.

143
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:00,920
From now on,

144
00:11:01,540 --> 00:11:02,740
aside from business,

145
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,980
we'll never see each other again.

146
00:11:05,850 --> 00:11:06,740
Business?

147
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:10,200
There's more between us

148
00:11:11,090 --> 00:11:13,640
than just cold business.

149
00:11:17,990 --> 00:11:19,320
We'll meet again,

150
00:11:20,370 --> 00:11:21,280
Tinglan.

151
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,380
I'm going abroad for business.

152
00:11:50,380 --> 00:11:52,400
I left your work badge on your desk.

153
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,720
Coordinate with Zhang Cheng
on all business matters.

154
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,840
Submit your work report daily.

155
00:11:57,430 --> 00:11:58,600
Got it, Mr. Zhuo.

156
00:12:05,980 --> 00:12:07,110
[Office]

157
00:12:07,450 --> 00:12:11,070
[Office]

158
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:31,720
Don't forget to eat,
no matter how busy you get.

159
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:33,980
We'll talk about the rest when I get back.

160
00:12:34,420 --> 00:12:36,080
I'll handle everything here.

161
00:12:45,060 --> 00:12:48,550
[Zhuoyuan Technology
Name: Shu Tinglan]
